RABAAB KEHTI THI ROKAR MERI SAKINA JAAN,<br>
 YE NEEND KAISI HAI DILBAR MERI SAKINA JAAN<br>
<br>
UJAD GAYI MERI GODI BICCHAD GAYA ASGHAR,<br>
 JIGAR PE KHA KE SINA CHAL BASA ALI AKBAR,<br>
 GUZAR GAYA MERA WALI KOI NAHIN SAR PAR,<br>
 JEYEGI KAISE YE MAADAR MERI SAKINA JAAN<br>
<br>
MILA NA BAAP KA SINA TUMHE MERI BACCHI,<br>
 NA TUM KO BAAD-E-PIDAR NEEND AA SAKI BIBI,<br>
 PHATA HUA TERA KURTA WO JIS MEIN AAG LAGI,<br>
 HAI YE NIGAAHON MEIN MANZAR MERI SAKINA JAAN<br>
<br>
WO QAID E SHAAM KI TAREEKI WO TUMHARI FUGHAAN,<br>
 YAHAN TOH GHUT TA HAI DAM MERA AAO BABA JAAN,<br>
 MADAD KO LAIYE MERI CHACHA GAYE HAIN KAHAN,<br>
 PIDAR KA AAGAYA AB SAR MERI SAKINA JAAN<br>
<br>
LAHOO BHARA HUA KURTA BANA TUMHARA KAFAN,<br>
 WO TERE NEELGOON RUKHSAAR AUR GALE MEIN RASAN,<br>
 NA ITNE SIN MEIN SAHA KOI AYESE RANJ-O-MAHAN,<br>
 HAI SHARM SAAR YE MAADAR MERI SAKINA JAAN<br>
<br>
SOHAIL SUN KE YE ROTE THE SAARE AHLEHARAM,<br>
 RABAB KARTI THI NOUHA JO DAM BADAM PAIHAM,<br>
 NA TUJHKO CHHOD KE JAONGI MERI JAAN IS DAM,<br>
 JO TUM CHALOGI NA AB GHAR MERI SAKINA JAAN..